WEBVTT

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.370
Ume?

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:38.580
Hmm?

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:45.790
Has Masa been doing well?

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.130
No, he hasn’t.

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:53.320
Oh?

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:56.790
Aren’t you going to visit him?

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:57.680
Hmm?

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:02.520
The old man also wants to see you.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:08.450
I drew you a map in case you don’t want to go with me.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:17.430
Once you take a look, burn it and then get rid of the ashes.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:34.250
Sundries Place

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:37.460
Sen-san.

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:55.270
The boss will be coming to Edo shortly.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:03:01.240
Your name might even come up when he arrives.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.830
B-But I gave you the money!

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.000
You’re gonna run?

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:15.340
You understand, right? It’d be a waste if we don’t put your skills to work.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:22.560
Think of that last payment as an apology
for putting us through all that grief back then.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:26.850
You don’t want anything to
happen to your wife and kid, right?

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:33.270
You’ll be working for the Sengorou crew from Yatsuya.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:38.000
Consider yourself lucky.

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:00.080
Well, if it isn’t Toku-san.

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:12.860
Souji-don’, it’s been a while! I just arrived in Edo!

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:19.520
Oh, we have an unfamiliar guest.

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:21.160
He’s recuperating right now.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.350
It appears he has the “Edo disease.”

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:26.040
So, you’re taking care of him?

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:28.050
That’s just like you, Souji-don’.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.060
Toku-san is an old friend of mine.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:35.700
He came here to shoot the breeze.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:40.590
The “Edo disease”? I hear it disappears once you go back to your hometown.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.990
It probably means you’re just not used to Edo’s food.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:51.370
It’s a mandarin I received en route.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:53.520
Here, eat.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:05:02.010
I’ve heard the Sengorou crew from
Yatsuya will be operating in Edo soon.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:04.160
What sort of folks are they?

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:10.750
They are very precise with their work, but they have a very rough disposition going about it.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:16.730
We might also have fellows going around seeking favors from their old bosses.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:20.260
Souji-don’, be careful.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:23.310
I’m currently out of the business.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:27.640
I just tell whoever comes that I can’t do a thing.

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:35.400
There are still people out there
who rely on The Buddha’s mercy.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.320
Welcome!

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:09.460
You know that you’ll get better once you return home, but you won’t.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.680
Is there a reason for staying in Edo?

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:17.150
It’s more due to the fact that I cannot return home.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:22.140
However, I do like Edo. I’m making new friends.

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:26.740
You are consorting with some bad characters. You know that, right?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:33.000
You’ve been telling me that ever since we first met.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.080
It’s because you’re not cut out for it.

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:43.090
So, you made efforts to free Ume-dono from his duties because he wasn’t cut out for them?

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:51.100
Looks like you’re starting to
speak what’s been on your mind.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:07:00.330
But worrying about it will not get you anywhere.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.070
I know.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:11.370
But friends and allies are those who intervene in each other’s situations, sharing what they have.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:15.770
It is like being part of a family.

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:18.880
Ume-dono looks up to you very much.

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:22.050
He speaks of you as much as he does of himself.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:27.000
You also speak of Ume-dono as well, right?

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:33.800
I guess I do tend to run off at the mouth.

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:41.230
I forced you to close early.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:46.380
How old is she now?

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:50.930
Sixteen.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:54.620
Do you know any ways to earn money?

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:59.900
Only ways that are shady, but I
don’t know about the specifics.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:02.770
They do pretend to be chivalrous thieves.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:11.180
Boy, was I stupid. I knew they
wouldn’t be satisfied with just money.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.910
You must resent me.

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:19.890
Likewise, I’m sure.

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:24.280
The old man cared for you.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:27.870
He cared for everyone the same.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:30.310
No, that wasn’t so.

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:35.620
He’d do anything for those who weren’t cut out for the evil life.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:39.150
That must mean they’re of no use to the crew.

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:43.630
I know. That’s why I can never repay him.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:01.850
Huh. So, this is where Ume set up shop.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.280
Denshichi!

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:11.360
I was wondering how you’d come up with the money.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:14.070
So, you’re going to extort money from Ume?

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:18.950
You must really hate that guy.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:21.000
Don’t you dare touch him!

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.960
He’s living a respectful life.

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:28.690
I just went there to drink.

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:32.330
All right, where are you getting the money?

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:37.390
I plan to work alone...

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:41.800
Don’t lie to me.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:47.820
Do you want me to extort him myself?

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:57.640
Well, I guess I’ll go have a few drinks at Ume’s place.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:01.700
Buddha... Souji!

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:07.830
Oh, so you relied on The Buddha?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:12.070
So, where is The Buddha staying?

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.550
You’re still awake?

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:25.620
Mm-hmm.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:34.110
Daddy?

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:34.690
Huh?

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:39.450
Are you working for the Five
Leaves to get money for that man?

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:41.580
Kinu!

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:50.670
I know you’re not earning that money for me or for yourself.

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:54.590
Uh... well...

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:57.340
You don’t have to talk about it.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:01.720
You’re a fine man, Daddy.

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:16.040
You’ll catch a cold if you sleep like that, Daddy.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.610
Hot, hot!

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:26.080
Here, take this one since it’s already peeled.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.790
Thank you, Masa.

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:31.710
I have to say,

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:35.660
I’ve heard much about you from Ume, Otake-san.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.930
Yet, you are more beautiful than I imagined.

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:43.290
You’d be too good for Ume.

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:43.930
Well...

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.430
Do take your time and enjoy yourself.

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:51.060
I also invited Ichi-san today.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.410
Yaichi-dono?

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:55.850
But he said, “Maybe next time.”

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:00.840
I’m sure he’ll come to see you in due time.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:05.630
Now, what kind of man is this Ichi-san?

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:07.370
What did Ume say about him?

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:11.630
Not much. He was always talking about you, Otake-san.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:15.060
How do you see him, Masanosuke?

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:17.760
I ask because you’re honest.

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:26.170
Yaichi-dono... is somewhat frightening.

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:30.480
He walls himself off from others,
but even at that, to draw a picture of him...

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:36.940
He’s like a fallen leaf on top of a flowing river.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.230
What did you say?!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.990
And you told them where the old man lives?

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:45.210
And to Denshichi of all people...

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:48.710
I never thought Denshichi would go after our boss, The Buddha.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:52.410
But he’s the guy who used shameless flattery to get close to The Demon Spider!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.630
Why did you tell him?!

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:07.700
Ichi-san, Daddy left.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:11.310
I’m good, as long as I have sake and a little bit of fish.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.450
Huh?

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:18.940
Okinu, can you get me a snack?

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:31.700
Things seem to go over your head, Boss Buddha.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:39.000
I’m saying if you give me the money you’re giving Senkichi, I’ll stop following him around.

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:43.680
Still, you are definitely The Buddha, Boss,

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:47.890
lending a hand to Senkichi who
caused the crew so much trouble.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.650
I do not give money to men like you.

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.100
Huh?

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:54.730
Leave!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.100
Boy!

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:03.990
It’s nothing!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.950
Nothing must have happened!

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.510
Stand back, Masanosuke!

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:12.940
If anything happened to you...

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:17.900
...I’d never be able to show my face to Ume-dono!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:23.300
Are you a fool? What are you gonna do with those tongs?

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:31.890
Masa!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:42.730
Just as with the old man, if anything happens to Otake-dono, I can never show my face to Ume-dono!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.000
Now we’re cooking.

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.040
Old man!

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.880
Denshichi, you bastard!

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:11.810
How dare you pull this on our boss, the one who took care of you!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:18.010
If you go back further, Senkichi also broke our charter, right?

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:23.420
But you have to feel for him. He was forsaken, you see.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:31.780
Only because of people like you.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.290
I should have done this from the start.

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:51.370
My apologies, Boss. I used your knife.

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:55.060
I’m leaving Edo.

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:56.720
What about your wife and kid?

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.050
I’m taking them with me.

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.400
I can’t leave them behind.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:17.290
I also didn’t have much when I left the crew.

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:21.570
But take what little I can give.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:24.500
Please forgive me, Senkichi.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.800
I caused you great pains.

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:37.630
Boss!

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.680
I’ll bury him once it gets dark.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:02.170
What will you do from now on?

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.530
Will you work for the Five Leaves?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.130
I’ll think about it a bit.

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:12.290
Also, did you get hurt?

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:15.430
Masanosuke shielded me.

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:24.880
Otake-dono, did you know about Ume-dono’s situation?

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:26.130
Nope.

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:32.420
I didn’t know all the details, but he seemed to be having a hard time.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:40.490
Thank you.

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:44.080
It’s great that you’ve reached a conclusion.

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:47.340
It’s great that you were here for us.

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:52.110
If anything happened to the old man, my own death would be of no recompense.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:55.340
I did nothing of importance.

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:58.090
Even this wound was the result of my inattentiveness.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.920
There’s no replacement for protecting someone.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:04.630
I am in your debt!

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:07.880
What? Please stop!

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:10.070
My peace of mind demands it!

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.750
But...

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:14.480
Just remain silent and accept it!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:19.450
If Masa had been healthy, we would have seen him pass judgment with his sword.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:26.670
Now it’s just a question of whether
Denshichi spoke about us to his partners.

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:29.560
Oh, no need to worry.

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:30.120
Hmm?

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:35.730
When Senkichi-san and Denshichi
were talking, Matsu was eavesdropping.

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.850
Then, he relayed the info to Ichi-san.

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:42.620
Matsu must be taking on the crew right around now.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.310
Taking them on?

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.860
He doesn’t even know where they are.

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:51.230
Well, he’s been following Denshichi quite closely.

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:55.780
Right now, I think Ichi-san is taking a seat at your place.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:57.740
Ichi?

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:02.680
Now’s not the time to leave Okinu-chan alone.

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:10.280
They’re just doing it so they won’t have to worry about the Five Leaves being exposed.

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:13.550
So...

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:20.370
Are Matsukichi-dono and Yaichi-dono concerned about Ume-dono?

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:24.570
Masa.

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:25.520
Yes?

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:31.070
That’s something better kept
to yourself and not mentioned.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.170
I-Is that so?

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:59.240
Hey, if you say you’re taking a hot bath, that would mean you’re actually cleaning yourself, Masa.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:03.970
And on this cold day, no less...

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:08.750
I thought maybe I should go out and brace myself.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.410
Yaichi-dono!

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:16.900
Masa.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.670
Thank you for taking the time to come.

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:23.720
Have you completely recovered?

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:28.030
I thought I should stay here. At least for today anyway.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.120
Really?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:35.270
And besides, I look terrible... I need to change my clothes.

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:39.090
I see.

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:43.760
Now, I know why you haven’t shown your face even once.

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:49.350
Yaichi...

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.610
...was you all along, right?

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:16.060
I’ve got a feeling that something was hidden

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:25.350
in the words you once told me. Those words cross my mind again and again.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:33.770
Yet your voice always sounds the same as before.

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:40.820
Every time I breathe, I wanna hold you in my arms

00:21:41.220 --> 00:21:49.750
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:21:50.590 --> 00:21:57.830
Every time I breathe, I just wanna hold you in my arms again

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:06.650
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:22:07.310 --> 00:22:14.890
Every day I need you  All the time I'll be there for you

00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:24.000
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:33.240
Next time on House of Five Leaves:

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:35.800
This is the old man.

00:22:35.800 --> 00:22:38.410
I am living out my retirement in the countryside,

00:22:38.410 --> 00:22:44.340
but there are people who brought seeds, claiming that they grow into strange, foreign vegetables.

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.380
However, I’m still alive and kicking.

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:48.010
Well then, the next episode’s title is:

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:49.970
“Unrefined.”
